abstract: "Analysis code and selected derived materials supporting a study of phenotype decomposition and the interpretation of genetic correlation versus unstandardized genetic covariance across operational lean-mass phenotypes. This repository is a partial reproducibility release; it does not provide a one-command rerun of the full GWAS-to-LDSC-to-GenomicSEM pipeline."
